/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (The intent was to demystify organisational leadership and remind everyone that behind every title lies a personal journey of dilemmas, pivots, and resilience. Participants had the chance to ask questions they may have been carrying silently; about navigating career crossroads, staying anchored to values, or finding joy outside of work. Leaders, in turn, reflected openly on what drives them, the red lines they hold, and the moments of conflict or clarity that shaped their paths.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
