/E (The Annual Forum was a culmination of nearly a year of preparation,beginning with the idea first proposed at the Steering Committee Meeting in October 2024. Since then, over the course of multiple virtual and in-person Steering Committee Meetings and many discussions at an individual level with members, the Annual Forum began taking shape. )
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [4]
>>
